    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning one-bedroom dual-aspect open-plan apartment with a large south-facing terrace and own-door access.\n\nThis exceptional property features an entrance hall with laminate flooring and a hotpress. To the right of the hallway is a high-spec L-shaped stylish kitchen with laminate flooring, splashback tiling, plenty of counter and cupboard space, and is separate from the living and dining area.To the left of the hall is a generous, partially tiled bathroom with well-kept sanitary ware and additional space for under-sink storage.From the hall, you continue into a spacious double bedroom with sophisticated fitted wardrobes and access to the amazing south-facing terrace.The light-filled open-plan living and dining area also benefits from access to the large terrace, which overlooks the River Camac, making it the perfect place to relax and entertain.\n\nSt. John's Well Way is an attractive gated development with the River Camac running through the communal gardens.Ideally located in Kilmainham, with a range of shops, cafes, bars and restaurants on your doorstep. IMMA, the Memorial Gardens, Phoenix Park and the Grand Canal are all close by, while the Red Line LUAS is just a short stroll away, providing easy access to the city centre. St. James's Hospital and the new Children's Hospital are also within walking distance.\n\n\nFeatures:\nYear of construction 2005\nLarge south facing terrace\nSought after location \nRiver Camac views\nDual aspect\nOpen plan\nFully tiled bathroom\nOwn door access"
